{"id":"en_dubbed-his-thorns-her-sparks","title":"(Dubbed) His Thorns, Her Sparks","titleEn":"(Dubbed) His Thorns, Her Sparks","description":"He comes from wealth but has none of it left, armed with a sharp tongue and a heart that's already been shattered. She's the silent type who absorbs everything without complaint—until the day she stops. Forced to share the same desk, the two lob cruelty at each other like it's a contest. But then he witnesses her at her most vulnerable, and she catches him at his lowest point. What becomes clear is that the harshest exterior often hides the deepest hurt. And she's willing to endure some pain to get through to him.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/dubbed-his-thorns-her-sparks/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/dubbed-his-thorns-her-sparks/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Slow-Burn Romance","Strong Female Lead","Campus","Sweet Romance","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6tn4/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_dubbed-his-thorns-her-sparks_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6tn4/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_dubbed-his-thorns-her-sparks_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6tn4/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_dubbed-his-thorns-her-sparks_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6tn4/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_dubbed-his-thorns-her-sparks_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD 